cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the dataset."
title: "HMCP: an always-valid chemical-cleaning date for membrane bioreactors"
abstract: >-
  Code for physics-constrained prognostics of irreversible membrane fouling. Crossflow TMP is converted to
  viscosity-corrected resistance, decomposed into reversible and irreversible parts, and forecast with a
  hard-monotone cumulative parameterisation (HMCP) that returns a unique cleaning date by construction.
authors:
